{
  "info": {
    "name": "AutoCategory AI",
    "_postman_id": "6a1fd7ba-ae34-4ae9-8fd8-1d5ff0d9d201",
    "description": "AutoCategory AI — Laravel 11 (web + API) + optional FastAPI (internal).\n\n**Production:** Environment **AutoCategory AI — Production**. `base_url` = public site (HTTPS, no `/api`). JSON API = `{{base_url}}/api/...`.\n\n**Web:** **Web (public)** folder — landing page at `/`, Laravel health at `/up`.\n\n**Auth:** **Login** / **Register** save `auth_token`. **Login (Admin)** sets `admin_token`.\n\n**ML (FastAPI):** `ml_base_url` is usually `http://127.0.0.1:8001` (VPS localhost or SSH tunnel). `/predict` returns `prediction_source`: `model` | `keyword_fallback` | `gemini_fallback`. `/health` includes `gemini_enabled` and `gemini_force_verify`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Sanctum JSON API. **Login** / **Register** save `auth_token` automatically.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "let payload = {};",
                  "try { payload = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
                  "const token = payload?.data?.token || payload?.token || '';",
                  "if (token) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('auth_token', token);",
                  "  if (payload?.data?.user?.role === 'admin') {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('admin_token', token);",
                  "  }",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{user_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{user_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/login",
            "description": "Login as regular user. Saves **auth_token** to the active environment.\nIf the user role is **admin**, also saves **admin_token**.\n\nStatus codes: 200, 422"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": { "method": "POST", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/api/login" },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Login successful.\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"2|exampletoken\",\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": 2,\n      \"name\": \"Student User\",\n      \"email\": \"student@example.com\",\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"status\": \"active\"\n    }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  let payload = {};",
                  "  try { payload = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
                  "  const token = payload?.data?.token || payload?.token || '';",
                  "  if (token) pm.environment.set('auth_token', token);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status is 201 when successful', function () { pm.expect([201,422]).to.include(pm.response.code); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Student User\",\n  \"email\": \"{{user_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{user_password}}\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"{{user_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/register",
            "description": "Create user account. On **201**, saves **auth_token** if the API returns a token.\n\nStatus codes: 201, 422"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "originalRequest": { "method": "POST", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/register" },
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Registration successful.\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"1|exampletoken\",\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": 2,\n      \"name\": \"Student User\",\n      \"email\": \"student@example.com\",\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"status\": \"active\"\n    }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "let payload = {};",
                  "try { payload = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
                  "const token = payload?.data?.token || payload?.token || '';",
                  "if (token) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('auth_token', token);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('admin_token', token);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/login",
            "description": "Login with **admin** credentials. Saves both **auth_token** and **admin_token**.\n\nStatus codes: 200, 422"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/logout",
            "description": "Revoke current access token.\n\nStatus codes: 200, 401"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": { "method": "POST", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/logout" },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Logout successful.\",\n  \"data\": null\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
